   @X0F[@X0EQWK@X0F] @X0DQWK UPLOAD/DOWNLOAD
 
      @X0BThis command will allow you to transfer mail packets in QWK format to
      and from the BBS.  Using the appropriate programs, mail can be read
      and replied to off-line.
 
        @X0AExamples:
 
          @X0BTo upload a QWK packet (.REP format):
 
            @X0EQWK U @X0F[@X0CENTER@X0F]
 
          @X0BTo download a QWK packet:
 
            @X0EQWK D @X0F[@X0CENTER@X0F]
 
          @X0BTo download/upload a QWK packet and disconnect immediately:
 
            @X0EQWK D BYE @X0F[@X0CENTER@X0F]
            @X0EQWK U BYE @X0F[@X0CENTER@X0F]
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
